# Local secrets files — NEVER commit. The actual values live in the
# sibling `autogenesis-secrets/` repo (per the 2026-06-29 source-available
# scrub plan). Copy the committed `*.properties` stub and rename to
# `*.local.properties`, then fill in real values. Sync via
#   <path-to-autogenesis-secrets>/sync.sh
# which is tested and passing per commit ba55d3c.
*.local.properties

